Z||000009||Haze_Performance||02-22-2001||03:36 PM||||This is the info the guy sent me:<P><B>These gauges are not stickers, they are electroluminescent gauge faces, they<BR>come with small neon transformers. They are similar to the speed glo and APC<BR>indiglo gauges. On the coupe version you have to drill out the metal face<BR>and attach the new gauge in it's place. I will get some better and more<BR>detailed pictures for you.<P>Henry<BR>Boomin Industries &lt;boomin@superior.net&gt; </B><BR><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ttttttt.gif"> </A>       <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>PFF Members Photo Page</A><BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1431213" TARGET=_blank><BR>Photopoint Gallery</A>||||reg||7
